#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:-1
msgid "Add your existing documentation from a Git repository into Read the Docs."
msgstr "将你现有的文档从 Git 仓库添加到 Read the Docs。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:2
msgid "Adding a documentation project"
msgstr "添加文档项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:7
msgid ""
"This page takes you through the process of adding a documentation project to"
" Read the Docs. If you have :doc:`connected your Read the Docs account "
"</guides/connecting-git-account>` to GitHub, Bitbucket, or GitLab, and you "
"have admin access to the repository you want to add, you will be able to add"
" your project automatically. Otherwise, you will need to add it manually and"
" perform some extra steps."
msgstr ""
"本页将引导你完成向 Read the Docs 添加文档项目的过程。如果你已经 :doc:`将 Read the Docs 账户关联 </guides"
"/connecting-git-account>` 到 GitHub、Bitbucket 或 "
"GitLab，并且对要添加的仓库拥有管理员权限，就可以自动添加项目。否则，你需要手动添加并执行一些额外步骤。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:14
msgid "Automatically add your project"
msgstr "自动添加项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:16
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:36
msgid "Go to your :term:`dashboard`."
msgstr "前往你的 :term:`dashboard`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:17
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:37
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Add project`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Add project`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:18
msgid ""
"Type the name of the repository you want to add and click on it. If you are "
"using our :ref:`reference/git-integration:GitHub App`, make sure you have "
"installed the :ref:`Read the Docs GitHub App <reference/git-"
"integration:Troubleshooting>` in your repository."
msgstr ""
"输入你要添加的仓库名称并点击它。如果你正在使用我们的 :ref:`reference/git-integration:GitHub "
"App`，请确保已在你的仓库中安装 :ref:`Read the Docs GitHub App <reference/git-"
"integration:Troubleshooting>`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:21
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:39
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Continue`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Continue`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:22
msgid "Edit any of the pre-filled fields with information of the repository."
msgstr "根据仓库信息修改任何预填充的字段。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:23
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:41
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Next`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Next`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:24
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:42
msgid "Add a :term:`configuration file` to your repository if it doesn't exist yet."
msgstr "如果你的仓库中还没有 :term:`configuration file`，请添加一个。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:25
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:43
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`This file exists`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`This file exists`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:29
msgid ":doc:`/reference/git-integration`"
msgstr ":doc:`/reference/git-integration`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:30
msgid ""
"Your project will be automatically configured with a Git integration. Learn "
"more about all the features enabled by that integration on this page."
msgstr "你的项目将自动配置 Git 集成。在此页面了解该集成启用的所有功能。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:34
msgid "Manually add your project"
msgstr "手动添加项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:38
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Configure manually`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Configure manually`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:40
msgid "Fill all the fields of the form."
msgstr "填写表单中的所有字段。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:45
msgid ""
"Once your project is created, you'll need to manually configure the "
"repository webhook if you would like to have new changes trigger builds for "
"your project on Read the Docs."
msgstr "项目创建后，如果你希望新的变更能在 Read the Docs 上触发项目构建，就需要手动配置仓库 Webhook。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:49
msgid ":doc:`/guides/setup/git-repo-manual`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/setup/git-repo-manual`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:50
msgid ""
"Additional setup steps required for manually created projects. This guide "
"covers setting up SSH keys and webhook integrations."
msgstr "手动创建的项目所需的额外设置步骤。本指南介绍如何设置 SSH 密钥和 Webhook 集成。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:53
msgid "Build your documentation outside Read the Docs"
msgstr "在 Read the Docs 之外构建文档"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:55
msgid ""
"If you build your documentation in your own pipeline, for example in GitHub "
"Actions, choose :guilabel:`Build externally and upload` instead of adding a "
"configuration file, and click on :guilabel:`I will upload my documentation`."
" Read the Docs won't build your project, and your pipeline uploads the "
"documentation instead. See :doc:`/guides/build/direct-upload` for the "
"complete setup."
msgstr ""
"如果你在自己的流水线中构建文档（例如在 GitHub Actions 中），请选择 :guilabel:`Build externally and "
"upload` 而不是添加配置文件，然后点击 :guilabel:`I will upload my documentation`。Read the "
"Docs 不会构建你的项目，而是由你的流水线上传文档。完整设置请参阅 :doc:`/guides/build/direct-upload`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:62
msgid "What's next"
msgstr "下一步"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:64
msgid ""
"Once your documentation project is created, a build will be triggered. It "
"will automatically fetch the code from your repository and build the "
"documentation. You can see the logs for the build process from your "
":term:`dashboard`."
msgstr "文档项目创建后，将触发一次构建。它会自动从你的仓库获取代码并构建文档。你可以从 :term:`dashboard` 查看构建过程的日志。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:70
msgid ":doc:`/builds`"
msgstr ":doc:`/builds`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:71
msgid "Explanation about the build process."
msgstr "关于构建过程的说明。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:73
msgid ":doc:`/config-file/index`"
msgstr ":doc:`/config-file/index`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:74
msgid "Practical steps to add a configuration file to your documentation project."
msgstr "向文档项目添加配置文件的实际步骤。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:76
msgid ":doc:`/versions`"
msgstr ":doc:`/versions`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:77
msgid "Manage multiple versions of your documentation project."
msgstr "管理文档项目的多个版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/add-project.rst:79
msgid ""
"If you have any trouble, don't hesitate to reach out to us. The "
":doc:`support </support>` page has more information on getting in touch."
msgstr "如果遇到任何问题，欢迎随时联系我们。:doc:`support </support>` 页面提供了更多联系方式。"

